  "text_pages": [
    "Buddy Program - International Welcome e-desk - University of Strasbourg\nShare the page :\nAdd the page to your favorites :\nPage has been added to favorites\nPage has been removed from favorites\nBuddy Program\nThe University of Strasbourg offers a variety of support services (buddy program, doctoral student associations, Unistra alumni network...) to help you integrate into the university as a student or as a professional.\nInternational Buddy Program at the University of Strasbourg\nAssociations of PhD students and PhD holders\nUnistra Alumni Network: an International multi-disciplinary network\nUniversity Integration\nSign up for Unistra's International Buddy Program! You'll benefit from student support to help you prepare for your arrival (Instabuddy) and integrate more easily into your new life (Buddy Program).\nProfessional Integration\nThanks to the University of Strasbourg's Alumni network and online resources, students and researchers can benefit from real support in their professional integration.\nYour\nquestions about international welcome\nat the University of Strasbourg\nFollow us\nUniversity of Strasbourg\n- All rights reserved - 2009-2026 - TYPO3 Design :\nAMEOS\nMenu\nBrowse those links to navigate the website\nDisplay\nHide\nthe searchbox\nFill in your search :\nLaunch search\nClose\nOur audiences :\nStudent Profile\nResearcher Profile\nI think about it\nBefore\nmy arrival\nI am\nin\nStrasbourg\nBefore\nmy departure\nServices Pack"
  ],
